a transformed cosine function with a minimum value of $-1$ and a maximum value of $16.$" :question/worked-solution "A sinusoidal graph's midline (or vertical shift) is the horizontal line that divides it vertically in half. \n\nThe equation of the midline is given by\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{\\text{min}}$ and ${y}_{\\text{max}}$ are the minimum and maximum values of the function. The midline equals the average of the maximum and minimum values. \n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2} & =\\frac{-1+16}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the midline is $y=\\frac{15}{2}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528273 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6fcfc5d3-45b1-56e9-8bbc-d7751a85e586" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{19}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528242} {:answer/id #uuid "7f2f6e28-b301-50f8-8886-d7dd96f10d31" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=\\frac{9}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528246} {:answer/id #uuid "93b9e714-df26-5d8c-bc9b-266c87d2634b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528251} {:answer/id #uuid "c00a140a-956c-5f02-a63b-d6885ee6c245" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-19" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528270} {:answer/id #uuid "dd032ab2-2edf-5498-bed4-3c270050fd07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528279}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6fcfc5d3-45b1-56e9-8bbc-d7751a85e586" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{19}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528242} :answer-field/id #uuid "b46baf57-0f2e-52d2-913f-48e2d0d01a85" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528266}] :question/difficulty {:db/ide